tm64788,Movie,Take Me Out to the Ball Game,,,US,,1949,,93 min,"romance, sport, comedy","The Wolves baseball team gets steamed when they find they've been inherited by one K.C. Higgins, a suspected ""fathead"" who intends to take an active interest in running the team. But K.C. turns outs to be a beautiful woman who really knows her baseball. Second baseman Dennis Ryan promptly falls in love. But his playboy roommate Eddie O'Brien has his own notions about how to treat the new lady owner and some unsavory gamblers have their own ideas about how to handle Eddie."
tm83273,Movie,Pride and Prejudice,,,US,,1940,,118 min,"romance, drama","Mr. and Mrs. Bennet have five unmarried daughters, and Mrs. Bennet is especially eager to find suitable husbands for them. When the rich single gentlemen Mr. Bingley and Mr. Darcy come to live nearby, the Bennets have high hopes. But pride, prejudice and misunderstandings all combine to complicate their relationships and to make happiness difficult."
