tm52201,Movie,Shadows,,,US,,1959,PG,81 min,"romance, drama, music","The relationship between Lelia, a light-skinned black woman, and Tony, a white man is put in jeopardy when Tony meets Lelia’s darker-skinned jazz singer brother, Hugh, and discovers that her racial heritage is not what he thought it was."
tm100656,Movie,...And God Created Woman,,,FR,,1956,PG,95 min,"romance, drama, european","Juliette Hardy is sexual dynamite, and has the men of a French coastal town panting. But Antoine, the only man who affects her likewise, wouldn't dream of settling down with a woman his friends consider the town tramp."
