tm55130,Movie,The Machine That Kills Bad People,,,IT,,1952,,85 min,"fantasy, european, comedy","In Amalfi, a village on the Italian coast, an old man who seems to have strange powers gives Celestino Esposito, the local photographer, a dangerous ability."
