tm81703,Movie,Invasion of Astro-Monster,,,JP,,1965,G,96 min,"scifi, action","Astronauts Glenn and Fuji investigate Planet X and encounter mysterious aliens known as the Xiliens, who ask Earth's people to help save their world from ""Monster Zero"".  In exchange for borrowing Godzilla and Rodan, the Xiliens offer a cure for cancer. As Glenn investigates, he develops a romance with Miss Namikawa and uncovers the Xilien's true intentions."
