tm140798,Movie,Scooby-Doo! and the Samurai Sword,,,US,,2009,G,74 min,fantasy,"The Mystery Inc. gang takes a trip to Japan and finds themselves circling Asia and the Pacific in a treasure hunt, racing against the vengeful Black Samurai and his Ninja warriors to find the legendary Sword of Fate, an ancient blade fabled to possess extraordinary supernatural powers."
